{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1123371-a-thread-of-mythic-threads","id":1123371,"title":"A Thread of Mythic Threads","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-01T02:14:30-07:00","id":1123371,"title":"A Thread of Mythic Threads","content":"Mystical:<br /> <br /> - Light Trumps Shadow<br /> <br /> - Afflicting someone with some terrible curse is easier if they really deserve it<br /> <br /> - Making predictions or altering someone's fate (luck, abilities, supernatural nature) immediately after their birth<br /> <br /> Mechanical:<br /> <br /> - Hitting a machine makes it work<br /> <br /> Technological:<br /> <br /> - Popups can completely ruin a device if clicked on<br /> <br /> - &quot;Turning it off and on again&quot; can fix anything; good for rescuing your ruined focus<br /> <br /> Economic:<br /> <br /> - Laying off a significant part of the workforce generating greater profits<br /> <br /> Environmental:<br /> <br /> - Fire-based effects spreading very rapidly and dangerously in the height of summer in areas that consistently deal with wild-fires<br /> <br /> - Bad weather occurring around an important out-doors event in Britain<br /> <br /> - Snow on Christmas day<br /> <br /> Emotional:<br /> <br /> - Romantic control of emotions working with appropriate weather, such as rain or snow, or cold weather in general<br /> <br /> - I could just list rom-com tropes but I won't","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-02T22:04:04-07:00","id":1124178,"title":"","content":"- Big guys are intimidating.<br /> <br /> - For that matter, if a guy is big enough, punches just bounce off him.<br /> <br /> - If a car crashes, it will explode.<br /> <br /> - Knock over one tall object, and all similar objects in a line will fall like dominoes.<br /> <br /> - Did I fire six shots, or only five? (The answer: whichever is the most dramatically convenient).<br /> <br /> - You always lose signal when being chased by a madman or monster.<br /> <br /> - Take cover behind an object, and bullets won't penetrate it. Even if they really should.<br /> <br /> - Lock yourself in a big metal container (a fridge, a safe, etc) and you can survive an explosion.<br /> <br /> - Pictures can always be <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Vxq9yj2pVWk\" target=\"_blank\">enhanced</a>. There's no such thing as image resolution!<br /> <br /> - Smoke bombs perfectly obscure your escape.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-02T22:57:02-07:00","id":1124189,"title":"","content":"Not sure if it's threads, or simply coincidence-through-tropes...but I guess that's the same thing! Here we go. Highly depends on the audience of course.<br /> <br /> Modern cultural threads:<br /> - People can harmlessy be knocked unconcious for hours. Easily. Just whap the back of the head.<br /> - Shooting a screen will destroy the computer itself<br /> - You can easily hack into a computer by sitting down in front of it, and then wildly tapping the keyboard while looking calm and badass.<br /> - Destroying electronic locks from the outside opens the door.<br /> - Destroying electronic locks from the inside permanently seals the door.<br /> - Destroying electronic locks from the outside permanently seals the door if you tried to trap somebody or something.<br /> - A car or bike will continue to drive at the same speed when you let go of the controls and try to get onto another vehicle. The Technocracy later made this official by adding Cruise Control to cars.<br /> - When calmly walking away from an explosion about to happen (And you are aware of), it will not affect you, nor will debris hit you. #CoolGuysDon'tLookAtExplosions<br /> - As a matter of fact, radiating Max Calm while just standing there lets you not get hit by a lot of tumbling, falling or tossed things in general.<br /> - You *can* get punched into your nose repeatedly without even slightly bleeding or tearing up. Everybody knows that. Dozens of facepunches are just foreplay in a good brawl.<br /> - Shotguns send people flying backwards. Like, across corridors.<br /> - What's recoil?<br /> - What's reloading?<br /> - If you need to Reload under pressure, it's fine to toss away the empty guns and pull out an identical pair from your coat.<br /> - Grenades are as room-cleaning lethal or open-air surgical as you need them to be.<br /> - There will always be a truck with a cushioning load when you leap off that bridge","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 08-03-2017, 02:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-02T23:42:21-07:00","id":1124199,"title":"","content":"Duct tape fixes everything<br /> Wd40 makes even the most rusted bolt come loose<br /> Any lock can be picked with just a hair pin","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T01:52:16-07:00","id":1124226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BurritoMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1123371-a-thread-of-mythic-threads?p=1124199#post1124199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Duct tape fixes everything<br /> Wd40 makes even the most rusted bolt come loose<br /> Any lock can be picked with just a hair pin</div> </div> </div> </div>You can open locks with a credit card<br /> Getting hit by a bullet knocks you right over (in reality the force applied to you is tiny; people have started falling over when they don't need to because they think they should! Typically you can keep running or standing, you've just been, well, shot)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T13:34:42-07:00","id":1124454,"title":"","content":"-Old and abandoned houses have ghosts (actually, this may be true in WoD, but mythic thread nevertheless for a little poltergeist)<br /> <br /> -Dark powers are stronger at night<br /> <br /> -The full moon it's good for witchcraft, and for turning into a werewolf<br /> <br /> -a circle of salt protects against spirits/demons and such<br /> <br /> -a cross repels vampires, so does garlic<br /> <br /> -holy persons can milacurously cure sicknesses <br /> <br /> -black cats, breaking mirrors, etc...bring bad luck.<br /> <br /> -ninjas (using their black outfit even in daylight) can vanish in a puf of smoke<br /> <br /> -To pass a rod over a galley assures something will come out<br /> <br /> -a katana can cut anything<br /> <br /> -a guy wearing a trenchcoat surely has a katana that goes with it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T22:25:13-07:00","id":1124623,"title":"","content":"sports mythic thread: a team of misfits with a good leader can beat a team of professionals that is divided<br /> <br /> academic and work mythic thread: a long term project can be finished near the end by all-nighters, though usually massive quantities of caffeine are required as a focus","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T04:00:35-07:00","id":1127038,"title":"","content":"- Yelling the names of your attacks makes them more powerful and works as a focus. Simply combine with a stylish posture.<br /> <br /> - The opposite of above 'if a car crashes, it will explode', the chance of cars and motorbikes being able to pull off insane stunts and remaining intact grows with the absurdity of the stunt.<br /> <br /> - No matter how beaten and supposedly defeated somebody ends up, if they quip something along the lines of 'Oh? Is that all you can do?', they can rise up again and go on a devastating counterattack with their wounds turning out to be only superficial. They were just testing you.<br /> <br /> - Why yes, it is clearly possible to have such an aura of murder, that anybody who wants to attack you suddenly must build up courage to do so - no matter how harmless you seem.<br /> <br /> - The more nonchalant and relaxed you are in regards to an opponent or danger, the more are you bound to suddenly devastate them if they do not take you seriously. Clearly.<br /> <br /> - The opposite, the more you ridicule an opponent, the higher the chance you will fall in the next exchange of blows.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":".  Typo fixings. 08-10-2017, 07:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T05:26:50-07:00","id":1127061,"title":"","content":"Top to bottom, those seem like attributes of specific Mythic Threads and not entire Threads? <br /> <br /> Aren't Threads more like &quot;Stage Magic&quot;, &quot;Hollywood Action Rules&quot;, &quot;Dreamtime/Song Lines&quot;, &quot;Traditional Han Folkways&quot;, &quot;Druid-y Magic&quot; (which has less to do with what what the Celtic priestly caste was doing than with what modern people think they were doing...), &quot;Norse magic&quot;, etc.? Meaning it's easier to get away with the components of &quot;Hollywood Action Rules&quot; in day to day life in a modern American city than &quot;Dreamtime/Songlines&quot;, but &quot;Hollywood Action Rules&quot; fail when you are away from centers of Western civilization in the Outback?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T05:38:40-07:00","id":1127068,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1123371-a-thread-of-mythic-threads?p=1127061#post1127061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Top to bottom, those seem like attributes of specific Mythic Threads and not entire Threads?<br /> <br /> Aren't Threads more like &quot;Stage Magic&quot;, &quot;Hollywood Action Rules&quot;, &quot;Dreamtime/Song Lines&quot;, &quot;Traditional Han Folkways&quot;, &quot;Druid-y Magic&quot; (which has less to do with what what the Celtic priestly caste was doing than with what modern people think they were doing...), &quot;Norse magic&quot;, etc.? Meaning it's easier to get away with the components of &quot;Hollywood Action Rules&quot; in day to day life in a modern American city than &quot;Dreamtime/Songlines&quot;, but &quot;Hollywood Action Rules&quot; fail when you are away from centers of Western civilization in the Outback?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much! It always depends on the kind of reality zonne and culture you are in.<br /> Heck, depending on just how prominent a subculture is, it can depend on the city block.<br /> <br /> This thread's like an amalgam of 'Mythic Threads', 'Aspects of mythic Threads' (Or, if you want, Application of Mythic Threads) and 'Coincidence through Clich\u00e9s/Tropes'. Have fun with it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 08-10-2017, 08:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"h